    "text": "A circle S passes through the point (0, 1) and is orthogonal to the circles <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn> </math> and <math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mi>y</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </math>. Then"
